# An allowlist rather than a denylist. The context is now the working tree, and
# a local one holds mcp-nexus.yaml and mcp-nexus.dev.yaml - real service URLs
# and tokens - plus md/ notes. All gitignored, so CI never has them, but a
# denylist that missed one would put it in a local image without complaint.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!src/
